                          className="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 text-xs font-black uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-md active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer animate-pulse"
                          title="Visualizza e compila dati intestatario microchip ricavati dal veterinario ASL"
                        >
                          <span>🐕 Dati Intestatario ({missione.microchip})</span>
